"**Extends:** :class:`pybamm.expression_tree.unary_operators.UpwindDownwind`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/expression_tree/unary_operators.py:docstring
#: of pybamm.expression_tree.unary_operators.Downwind:1
msgid ""
"Downwinding operator. To be used if flow velocity is negative (right to "
